{"unit_id":"wood007924__dsh-approval-enter#feature-1","repo":"wood007924/dsh-approval-enter","commit":"f1ea206ace885b858b7d0dfba1738ed982b4cd80","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Enter to approve 的功能「新审批卡聚焦」：页面出现新的待处理审批卡时，插件将键盘焦点移到卡片的可聚焦区域；若用户正在文本控件中输入，则保留原焦点。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:45-55","client.js:105-131"]}
{"unit_id":"wood007924__dsh-approval-enter#feature-2","repo":"wood007924/dsh-approval-enter","commit":"f1ea206ace885b858b7d0dfba1738ed982b4cd80","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"Enter to approve 的功能「键盘确认或拒绝」：焦点离开审批卡且按键符合条件时，插件把 Enter 或 Escape 重新派发给卡片，由 DSH 现有处理逻辑完成批准或拒绝。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:57-79","client.js:87-103"]}
